00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:21.120
Then we could sell a video we shoot when the creatures break loose and chomp up the tourists.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.950
Return to your seats. We have just been cleared to land.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.320
